.TH PANELIVE-COMPANION 1 "September 2026" "0.1.0-beta.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
panelive-companion \- secure OBS Studio mobile companion
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B panelive-companion
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs the headless PaneLive Companion HTTPS, WebSocket, and WebRTC gateway and connects it to
OBS Studio through OBS WebSocket v5.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-open-management
Open the GTK management window.
.TP
.BI \-\-name " name"
Set the advertised Companion name.
.TP
.BI \-\-gateway-port " port"
Set the HTTPS and WebSocket listener port.
.TP
.BI \-\-obs-host " host"
Set the OBS WebSocket host.
.TP
.BI \-\-obs-port " port"
Set the OBS WebSocket port.
.TP
.BI \-\-obs-password " password"
Store the OBS password in the desktop Secret Service.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show command-line help.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show the Companion version.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.local/state/panelive-companion
contains current-user configuration, TLS identity, database, and diagnostics.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR obs (1)
